'''Converter Station''' was a business at [[Stobar Spaceport]] during the [[Clone Wars]],<ref name="Brothers" /> and [[Havoc Outpost]]<ref name="Sisters" /> and [[Horizon Base]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="Forgotten" /> During the [[First Order-Resistance War]], an advertisement for the company was seen on the exterior of [[Vranki's Hotel and Casino]], a [[space station]] in the [[Voxx Cluster]].<ref name="Voxx">{{Resistance|The Voxx Vortex 5000}}</ref> The business featured a [[Color|blue]] and white sign with a casual, handwritten [[Outer Rim Basic]] font,<ref name="Forgotten" /> stating the business' name.<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/blood-sisters-concept-art-gallery|text="Blood Sisters" Concept Art Gallery}} {{C|Slide 5}}</ref>

